    "name": "Shojo Warriors",
    "steam_appid": 3477920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As passionate fans of Nijigen and action-packed competitive games, the four of us set out to create an intense, fast-paced brawl game. After months of learning and experimenting with the game development tool &quot;CliCli,&quot; we are excited to present our passion project. Welcome to our discord  and share your thoughts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting and Tense Gameplay Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a chaotic arena filled with unpredictability, defeat your opponents and seize their bounty points. Once defeated, you'll lose your bounty points\u2014there\u2019s no such thing as a permanent lead; a comeback can happen instantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/b84ef036bc9fd780165e79109c754638.poster.avif?t=1740713354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/b84ef036bc9fd780165e79109c754638.webm?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/b84ef036bc9fd780165e79109c754638.mp4?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Equipment System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the thrilling battles, you can purchase various abilities through a unique equipment system, allowing you to create your fighting style. Crush your opponents in the next round and enjoy the strategy and economic management of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c8b6adda1a89d209371a7e0f0e824c9d.poster.avif?t=1740713354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c8b6adda1a89d209371a7e0f0e824c9d.webm?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c8b6adda1a89d209371a7e0f0e824c9d.mp4?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joyful Stealth and Positioning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize map obstacles for strategic positioning and master the art of dodging and weaving. Grow and develop in the corners while observing the chaos unfold. Conserve your strength before launching a joyful ambush to snatch the bounty!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c5862a320e41534886c5d0372bd0acb6.poster.avif?t=1740713354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c5862a320e41534886c5d0372bd0acb6.webm?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c5862a320e41534886c5d0372bd0acb6.mp4?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As passionate fans of Nijigen and action-packed competitive games, the four of us set out to create an intense, fast-paced brawl game. After months of learning and experimenting with the game development tool &quot;CliCli,&quot; we are excited to present our passion project. Welcome to our discord  and share your thoughts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting and Tense Gameplay Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a chaotic arena filled with unpredictability, defeat your opponents and seize their bounty points. Once defeated, you'll lose your bounty points\u2014there\u2019s no such thing as a permanent lead; a comeback can happen instantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/b84ef036bc9fd780165e79109c754638.poster.avif?t=1740713354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/b84ef036bc9fd780165e79109c754638.webm?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/b84ef036bc9fd780165e79109c754638.mp4?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Equipment System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the thrilling battles, you can purchase various abilities through a unique equipment system, allowing you to create your fighting style. Crush your opponents in the next round and enjoy the strategy and economic management of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c8b6adda1a89d209371a7e0f0e824c9d.poster.avif?t=1740713354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c8b6adda1a89d209371a7e0f0e824c9d.webm?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c8b6adda1a89d209371a7e0f0e824c9d.mp4?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joyful Stealth and Positioning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize map obstacles for strategic positioning and master the art of dodging and weaving. Grow and develop in the corners while observing the chaos unfold. Conserve your strength before launching a joyful ambush to snatch the bounty!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c5862a320e41534886c5d0372bd0acb6.poster.avif?t=1740713354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c5862a320e41534886c5d0372bd0acb6.webm?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477920/extras/c5862a320e41534886c5d0372bd0acb6.mp4?t=1740713354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Shojo Warriors is a fast-paced multiplayer brawl game set in a vibrant, anime-inspired fantasy world, made with\u300eCliCli\u300f. In this game, you'll purchase and combine equipment during battles to help the girls achieve victory through growth and strategic gameplay.",
